    "title": "Savannah teen arrested in armed robbery that left a man hurt - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By B.T. Clark ,\n14 hours ago SAVANNAH — A 17-year-old was arrested Tuesday in connection with a May armed robbery on Savannah’s eastside that left an adult man hurt. What happened: Just after 1:30 p.m. on May 6, a man was robbed and assaulted in the 1800 block of East 51st Street. Officers found him at the scene when they arrived. Arrest warrants for 17-year-old Bryson Love were issued two days later. Read full article\n8",
